{"availability":"available","full":"felixpalingan/IronPixels","name":"IronPixels","description":"A retro 16-bit gamified fitness & gym workout tracker RPG built with Next.js, Supabase, and Realtime Co-Op Raid.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-01T13:26:01Z","updated":"2026-10-12T05:25:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://iron-pixels.vercel.app","topics":["fitness-tracker","gamification","nextjs","pixel-art","pwa","realtime","rpg","supabase","typescript","workout-tracker"],"demo":"https://iron-pixels.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.553Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.553Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.553Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:42.528Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.553Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Level up your gym gains in retro 16-bit pixel RPG style.","A Progressive Web Application (PWA) that transforms barbell sweat and gym volume into heroic dungeon progression.","Conventional fitness tracking applications suffer from high churn because entering sets and reps quickly feels repetitive. IronPixels reinvents the gym routine by fusing weightlifting logs with classic retro MMORPG dungeon crawling."],"features":["Authoritative Relative Volume Score (RVS): Every repetition, set, and kilogram lifted is processed by a server-side algorithm that normalizes power based on bodyweight ratios and exercise movement tiers.","Pixel Art Retrogaming Aesthetic: 100% crisp pixel rendering using the acclaimed 0x72 Dungeon Tileset II, featuring gendered hero sprites, 27 dungeon weapons, animated mimic chests, and 18 diverse monster species.","Realtime Co-Op Guild Raids: Battle alongside party members in real time through Supabase Realtime WebSockets, synchronizing floating damage numbers, sound effects, and boss HP bars across screens with zero database…","Gym-Grade Experience: Features industry-standard utilities including previous session ghost values, single-click autofill, background-resilient rest timers, dynamic KG/LBS conversion, and routine presets."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/felixpalingan/IronPixels/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c340ef81ba9c75d72c03f8738d8af30bdeb941f72b786b647896d243b9e9c6d4","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.684Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.684Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Level up your gym gains in retro 16-bit pixel RPG style.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/felixpalingan/IronPixels/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c340ef81ba9c75d72c03f8738d8af30bdeb941f72b786b647896d243b9e9c6d4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/felixpalingan/IronPixels/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.684Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T05:25:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/felixpalingan/IronPixels/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:17.685Z","hash":"c340ef81ba9c75d72c03f8738d8af30bdeb941f72b786b647896d243b9e9c6d4","originalBytes":11812,"storedBytes":11812,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["default","text","int","supabase","null","boss","client","dungeon","realtime","rvs","damage","database","gym","party","react","across","canvas","combat","combatroutes","engine","key","level","max","npm","numeric","workout","auth","authroutes","create","ironpixels","pwa","state","unit","uuid","volume","weight","api","atomic","audio","bash","broadcast","build","chests","co-op","dual","end","engines","features","floating","gacha","ghost","hero","inventory","license","live","movement","now","optimized","pixel","postgresql","previous","primary","public","rest","retro","routine","run","security","server","session","sessions","sets","shoproutes","subgraph","system","table","test","testing","times","timestamptz","tracking","web","websockets","x72",